# CI/테스트용 소형 샘플 그래프 (합성 특허 — 라이선스 무관, 커밋 가능)
#
# 어휘는 SDKB v1.0 실물과 동일하다: TBox 는 ont:, 인스턴스는 data:.
# 공정 IRI/레이블은 SDKB ABox 에서 그대로 발췌했고(합성 아님), 특허 3건만 합성이다.
# 특허는 data:patent/ 아래에 둔다 — 상류 SDKB 와 충돌하지 않는 서브트리.
#
# 인스턴스 IRI 를 꺾쇠로 쓰는 이유: Turtle 접두명의 로컬 파트에는 '/' 가 올 수 없다
# (data:process/etch 는 문법 오류). SDKB 자신의 core-data.ttl 도 같은 이유로 꺾쇠를 쓴다.
@prefix ont:  <https://w3id.org/sdkb/ont/> .
@prefix gov:  <https://w3id.org/sdkb/gov/> .
@prefix pat:  <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/patent/> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

# TBox 발췌: SHACL 게이트가 RDFS 추론으로 SubProcess -> Process 를 유도해야
# ont:realizesProcess (range ont:Process) 가 SubProcess 링크도 허용한다.
ont:SubProcess rdfs:subClassOf ont:Process .

# 공정 계층 (SDKB ABox 발췌 — Process 2 + SubProcess 2)
<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/process/etch> a ont:Process ;
    skos:prefLabel "Etch"@en ; skos:altLabel "식각"@ko ;
    ont:hasSubprocess <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/subprocess/plasma_etch> .

<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/process/lithography> a ont:Process ;
    skos:prefLabel "Lithography"@en ; skos:altLabel "노광"@ko ;
    ont:hasSubprocess <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/subprocess/euv_lithography> .

<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/subprocess/plasma_etch> a ont:SubProcess ;
    skos:prefLabel "Plasma Etch"@en .

<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/subprocess/euv_lithography> a ont:SubProcess ;
    skos:prefLabel "EUV Lithography"@en .

# 디바이스 (개념 축의 두 번째 축 — H2 사례 HBM·GAA 가 여기 산다)
<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/device/hbm> a ont:Device ;
    skos:prefLabel "HBM"@en ; skos:altLabel "고대역폭 메모리"@ko .

# 출원인 (ont:assignedTo 의 range)
<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/organization/samsung_electronics> a ont:Organization ;
    skos:prefLabel "SAMSUNG ELECTRONICS CO., LTD."@en ; skos:altLabel "삼성전자"@ko .

# IPC 심볼 (H2 의 대조군 — 코드 단위 시계열)
<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/ipc/H01L21-3065> a ont:IPCSymbol ;
    skos:notation "H01L 21/3065" .
<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/ipc/H10B12-00> a ont:IPCSymbol ;
    skos:notation "H10B 12/00" .

# 합성 특허 3건 — 하위 SubProcess 링크와 상위 Process 링크를 모두 exercise 한다.
# CQ04~CQ08 이 요구하는 축(연도·IPC·출원인·디바이스)을 전부 때리도록 구성했다.
pat:1020200000001 a ont:Patent ;
    skos:prefLabel "플라즈마 식각 균일도 개선 방법"@ko ;
    ont:applicationNumber "1020200000001" ;
    ont:patentOffice "KR" ;
    ont:filingDate "2020-03-02"^^xsd:date ;
    ont:assignedTo <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/organization/samsung_electronics> ;
    ont:hasIPC <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/ipc/H01L21-3065> ;
    ont:realizesProcess <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/subprocess/plasma_etch> .

pat:1020210000002 a ont:Patent ;
    skos:prefLabel "EUV 마스크 결함 검사 장치"@ko ;
    ont:applicationNumber "1020210000002" ;
    ont:patentOffice "KR" ;
    ont:filingDate "2021-07-15"^^xsd:date ;
    ont:assignedTo <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/organization/samsung_electronics> ;
    ont:hasIPC <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/ipc/H01L21-3065> ;
    ont:realizesProcess <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/subprocess/euv_lithography> .

# 디바이스 축과 공정 축을 동시에 갖는 특허 — CQ07(교차)의 전제
pat:1020230000003 a ont:Patent ;
    skos:prefLabel "HBM 적층용 식각 공정 슬러리 조성물"@ko ;
    ont:applicationNumber "1020230000003" ;
    ont:patentOffice "KR" ;
    ont:filingDate "2023-01-20"^^xsd:date ;
    ont:assignedTo <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/organization/samsung_electronics> ;
    ont:hasIPC <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/ipc/H10B12-00> ;
    ont:concernsDevice <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/device/hbm> ;
    ont:realizesProcess <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/process/etch> .

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IP-R&D 축 (CQ09–CQ14) — 2026-07-14 · SPEC-004 단계 3.
#
# CQ 를 늘리면 픽스처도 늘어야 한다. mini_graph 의 계약은 "어떤 CQ 도 vacuous 하게
# 통과하지 않는다" 이고(SPEC-003), 그 계약이 곧 100% 를 요구하는 진짜 게이트의 근거다.
# 아래는 G₀ 에 실재하는 축(선행기술·인력·문제·공급망)의 **최소 합성 복제**다.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 선행기술 · 거절 (CQ09) — 인용 문헌은 서지가 없으므로 ont:Patent 로 타입하지 않는다.
# G₀ 도 인용 3,763건을 그렇게 다룬다.
<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/patent/us_US7000001> rdfs:label "Prior art: plasma etch endpoint detection" .

# 거절특허이자 CQ10 의 선행기술 후보(2013년 출원 · plasma_etch)를 겸한다.
pat:1020130000004 a ont:Patent, ont:RejectedPatent ;
    skos:prefLabel "플라즈마 식각 종점 검출 방법"@ko ;
    ont:applicationNumber "1020130000004" ;
    ont:patentOffice "KR" ;
    ont:filingDate "2013-05-10"^^xsd:date ;
    ont:assignedTo <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/organization/samsung_electronics> ;
    ont:hasIPC <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/ipc/H01L21-3065> ;
    ont:realizesProcess <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/subprocess/plasma_etch> ;
    ont:rejectedFor ont:Rejection_Inventiveness ;
    ont:hasPriorArt <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/patent/us_US7000001> ;
    ont:hasPriorArtExaminer <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/patent/us_US7000001> ;
    ont:abstractText "합성 초록 — 플라즈마 식각 종점 검출." ;
    ont:firstClaimText "청구항 1: 플라즈마 식각 종점을 검출하는 방법." ;
    ont:examinationStatus "거절결정(일반)" ;
    ont:publicationNumber "1020140000004" ;
    ont:processFamily "etch" ;
    ont:valueChainStage "fab" .

# 인력 (CQ11) — 공정이 요구하는 스킬과 전문가가 보유한 스킬이 만나야 한다.
# 인스턴스의 이름은 skos:prefLabel 이다 (SDKB `23d07a1` 에서 Expert·Problem 도 규약에 맞췄다 —
# 그 이전에는 rdfs:label 만 있어 이 질의가 IRI 만 돌려줬다).
<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/skill/endpoint_detection> a ont:Skill ;
    skos:prefLabel "Endpoint Detection"@en .

<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/subprocess/plasma_etch>
    ont:requiresSkill <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/skill/endpoint_detection> .

<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/expert/EXP_M01> a ont:Expert ;
    skos:prefLabel "전문가 M01"@ko ;
    skos:altLabel "Expert M01"@en ;
    ont:hasSkill <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/skill/endpoint_detection> ;
    ont:hasProcessExpertise <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/process/etch> ;
    ont:hasEquipmentExperience <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/equipment/lam_kiyo> .

# 소부장 실문제 (CQ12)
<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/problem/PROB_M01> a ont:Problem ;
    skos:prefLabel "Particle increase in etch chamber"@en ;
    ont:problemCategory "contamination" ;
    ont:involvesProcess <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/process/etch> ;
    ont:involvesEquipment <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/equipment/lam_kiyo> ;
    ont:requiresSkill <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/skill/endpoint_detection> .

# 공급망 (CQ13·CQ14) — 회사 하나 = IRI 하나. 공급 역할과 출원인 역할은 rdf:type 이 말한다.
<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/organization/lam_research> a ont:Organization, ont:Vendor ;
    skos:prefLabel "Lam Research"@en ;
    ont:companyType "장비업체" .

<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/equipment_class/etcher> a ont:EquipmentClass ;
    skos:prefLabel "Etcher"@en ;
    ont:madeBy <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/organization/lam_research> .

<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/equipment/lam_kiyo> a ont:Equipment ;
    skos:prefLabel "Lam Kiyo"@en ;
    ont:isInstanceOf <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/equipment_class/etcher> ;
    ont:providedBy <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/organization/lam_research> .

<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/subprocess/plasma_etch>
    ont:usesEquipmentClass <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/equipment_class/etcher> .

# 공급사의 특허 — 이 조인(공급 역할 ↔ 출원인 역할)이 정체성 통합 이전에는 0행이었다.
pat:1020190000005 a ont:Patent ;
    skos:prefLabel "식각 챔버 플라즈마 균일도 제어 장치"@ko ;
    ont:applicationNumber "1020190000005" ;
    ont:patentOffice "KR" ;
    ont:filingDate "2019-11-08"^^xsd:date ;
    ont:assignedTo <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/organization/lam_research> ;
    ont:hasIPC <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/ipc/H01L21-3065> ;
    ont:realizesProcess <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/subprocess/plasma_etch> .

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 불량 인과 · 재료 · 계측 축 (CQ15–CQ22) — 2026-07-14 · SPEC-004 단계 4.
# CQ 를 늘리면 픽스처도 늘어야 한다. 어떤 CQ 도 vacuous 하게 통과하지 않는다는 계약(SPEC-003)이
# 100% 를 요구하는 진짜 게이트의 근거다.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 불량 인과 사슬 (CQ15): 문제 → 불량 → (공정) → 근본원인 → 완화 → 스킬
<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/failure_mode/micro_trenching> a ont:FailureMode ;
    skos:prefLabel "Micro-trenching"@en ;
    ont:occursAtProcessStep <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/subprocess/plasma_etch> ;
    ont:isDueTo <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/root_cause/charging> .

<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/root_cause/charging> a ont:RootCause ;
    skos:prefLabel "Charging"@en ;
    ont:mitigatedBy <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/mitigation/recipe_tuning> .

<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/mitigation/recipe_tuning> a ont:Mitigation ;
    skos:prefLabel "Recipe Tuning"@en ;
    ont:mitigationProvidesSkill <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/skill/endpoint_detection> .

<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/problem/PROB_M01>
    ont:exhibitsFailureMode <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/failure_mode/micro_trenching> ;
    ont:involvesMaterial <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/material/euv_photoresist> .

# 재료 · 금기 (CQ16·CQ17)
<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/material/euv_photoresist> a ont:Material ;
    skos:prefLabel "EUV Photoresist"@en ;
    ont:incompatibleWith <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/material/hydrofluoric_acid> .

<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/material/hydrofluoric_acid> a ont:Material ;
    skos:prefLabel "Hydrofluoric Acid"@en .

<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/subprocess/plasma_etch>
    ont:usesMaterial <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/material/euv_photoresist> ;
    ont:hasParameter <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/parameter/bias_power> ;
    ont:measuredBy <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/metrology/cd_sem> .

<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/expert/EXP_M01>
    ont:hasMaterialExpertise <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/material/euv_photoresist> ;
    ont:hasEquipmentExperience <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/equipment_class/etcher> .

# 공정 제어 · 계측 (CQ19)
<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/parameter/bias_power> a ont:Parameter ;
    skos:prefLabel "Bias Power"@en .
<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/metrology/cd_sem> a ont:Metrology ;
    skos:prefLabel "CD-SEM"@en .

# 특허 ↔ 스킬 · 장비클래스 · 기술노드 (CQ18·CQ22)
<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/technology_node/n3> a ont:TechnologyNode ;
    skos:prefLabel "3nm"@en .

pat:1020200000001
    ont:concernsSkill <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/skill/endpoint_detection> ;
    ont:realizesEquipmentClass <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/equipment_class/etcher> ;
    ont:concernsTechnologyNode <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/technology_node/n3> .

# ── 규제·수출통제 축 (PLAN-015 · RQ3) — CQ23·CQ24·CQ25·CQ26 을 exercise ────────
# 합성 통제 2건: US EAR/CCL(HIGH) 이 EUV·CD-SEM 를, KR-ITPA(CRITICAL·국가핵심기술) 가
# HBM·식각을 통제한다. compliance_shape 가 이 노드들에 실제로 걸린다.
gov:JurisdictionUS a skos:Concept ; skos:prefLabel "United States"@en ; skos:notation "US" .
gov:JurisdictionKR a skos:Concept ; skos:prefLabel "Republic of Korea"@en ; skos:notation "KR" .

<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/gov/us/tech_control/ccl_3b001> a gov:EARRule ;
    skos:prefLabel "CCL_3B001"@en ; skos:notation "3B001.a" ;
    gov:controlLevel "HIGH" ; gov:hasJurisdiction gov:JurisdictionUS .

<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/gov/kr/tech_control/advanced_packaging> a gov:KRIndustrialTechRule ;
    skos:prefLabel "Advanced_Packaging"@en ; skos:notation "반도체_NCT_04" ;
    gov:controlLevel "CRITICAL" ; gov:hasJurisdiction gov:JurisdictionKR ;
    gov:designatedAsNCT <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/gov/kr/nct/advanced_packaging> .

<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/gov/kr/nct/advanced_packaging> a gov:NationalCoreTechnology ;
    skos:notation "반도체_NCT_04" ; gov:requiresGovApproval true .

# 개념 ↔ 통제 (concept gov:subjectToControl control)
<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/subprocess/euv_lithography>
    gov:subjectToControl <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/gov/us/tech_control/ccl_3b001> .
<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/metrology/cd_sem>
    gov:subjectToControl <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/gov/us/tech_control/ccl_3b001> .
<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/device/hbm>
    gov:subjectToControl <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/gov/kr/tech_control/advanced_packaging> .
<https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/process/etch>
    gov:subjectToControl <https://w3id.org/sdkb/data/gov/kr/tech_control/advanced_packaging> .
